      "writtenOn": "2023-08-04T21:58:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Keeping it as kSrc for now. Seems like an easy follow-up to do the rescaling in linear gamma. Avoiding intermediate surfaces would be a little more work I think but maybe worth looking into if we anticipate this being a common code path long-term.",
